## GL4ES

**Library:** GL4ES (OpenGL for GLES Hardware)
**Author:** ptitSeb
**Source:** https://github.com/ptitSeb/gl4es
**License:** MIT

GL4ES is a library that provides OpenGL 2.1 (with some 3.x extensions)
on top of OpenGL ES 2.0. Used as a shim so Wine/wined3d can use
desktop GL calls on devices that only expose GLES (via ANGLE).

